---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Customer Reviews | ApprovedTilers.co.uk" description="Read what UK homeowners say about our verified tilers.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Trusted by UK Homeowners</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">Real feedback from verified tiling projects across the country.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-2">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">"Flawless Victorian Pathway"</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">"The team did an incredible job restoring and retiling our front Victorian pathway. The alignment is absolutely perfect. Clean, polite, and stuck exactly to the quoted price."</p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">— Sarah M., London</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-2">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">"Bathroom Transformation"</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">"Booked through the site. The tiler was superb—laser levelled the large format porcelain tiles beautifully and did a complete waterproof tanking system. Highly recommended."</p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">— James T., Manchester</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-2">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">"Great Kitchen Splashback"</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">"Fast response and a very reasonable fixed quote. The herringbone tiling in our kitchen looks stunning. They cleaned up perfectly afterwards."</p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">— Emma W., Bristol</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Review 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex text-amber-400 mb-2">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">"Zero Hidden Costs"</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">"I was worried about rogue traders after a bad experience last year. The approved tiler we got was professional, insured, and there were zero hidden extras on the final bill."</p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">— David P., Birmingham</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
